{"ts":"2026-08-31T10:40:52.606Z","type":"quest-declared","sealed":{"doneWhen":{"probe":"test-receipt","args":{"file":"solve/evidence/critical-placement-formation-observer.receipt.json","requiredReceipts":["spread-critical-set-observes-converged","seed-local-critical-set-observes-pending","partial-spread-names-the-pending-partitions","unavailable-cache-is-typed-and-not-converged","observer-reads-only-the-services-table","observer-mints-no-readiness-state","barrier-release-is-unchanged-by-the-observation","witness-deterministic"]}},"frontierMetrics":[{"probe":"test-receipt","args":{"file":"solve/evidence/critical-placement-formation-observer.receipt.json","requiredReceipts":["spread-critical-set-observes-converged","seed-local-critical-set-observes-pending","partial-spread-names-the-pending-partitions","unavailable-cache-is-typed-and-not-converged","observer-reads-only-the-services-table","observer-mints-no-readiness-state","barrier-release-is-unchanged-by-the-observation","witness-deterministic"]}}],"authoringContractVersion":1,"statement":"Generalize the formation readiness primitive from 'has the operation ledger got off the seed?' to 'has the critical system-table set reached its required serving topology?': a single observer projects critical-placement convergence from the system-table cache and the formation barrier reports it as typed evidence. This slice observes and proves; making it a hard prerequisite for initial TRAFFIC_READY is the next slice, because a joiner that waited on spread it must itself supply would deadlock formation.","title":null,"class":"product","constraints":[{"id":"source-change-subagent-verification","statement":"If this Quest changes source code, spawn a subagent verifier before audit and git handoff, then record a Solver finding with evidence subagent:<id>."},{"id":"single-invariant-owner","statement":"The distinct-voting-node invariant keeps its single owner in critical-placement-convergence.js. This observer owns exactly one thing — reading the serving rows out of the system-table cache — and delegates every judgement to that evaluator; it re-derives no replication factor, no critical set and no convergence rule."},{"id":"observe-do-not-release","statement":"The formation barrier reports the observation and MUST NOT gate its release on it. A joiner that waited for spread which only its own join can supply would deadlock formation; the lifecycle owner consumes this evidence in a later slice. The sealed release condition stays the startup-authority answer, pinned by a control."},{"id":"fail-closed-typed","statement":"A cache that cannot answer is a distinct typed outcome and is never convergence; absent evidence is never read as satisfaction."},{"id":"projection-only","statement":"The observation is frozen, carries exactly state, converged, pendingPartitionIds and observedPartitionCount, mints no readiness phase, releases no barrier, and derives nothing from nodes.status, publication counts, or coverage."},{"id":"deterministic-first","statement":"Proof is a deterministic node:test witness over cache fixtures, with barrier-release-is-unchanged-by-the-observation as the control that must stay green; every guard is mutation-verified with a harness that asserts the patch anchor is unique, and no cloud run is part of the proof."}],"verificationTemplates":[],"landingRequirements":null,"frontierIds":["critical-placement-formation-observer-main"]}}
